OL,3,GNEWSAPM handed teen's letter calling
OL,4,Afor access to drug
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother said it was a "huge relief" to
OL,7,Fknow the prime minister had read a
OL,8,Fletter from her daughter calling for a
OL,9,Fpotentially life-changing drug to be
OL,10,Fmade available on the NHS.
OL,12,FBrogan Johnson, from Leigh-on-Sea in
OL,13,FEssex, was diagnosed with Friedreich's
OL,14,Fataxia in 2024, and the drug,
OL,15,Fomaveloxolone, costs #1,000 a day to
OL,16,Ffund privately in the UK.
OL,18,FThe 17-year-old and mum Karly Johnson
OL,19,Fdelivered the letter to 10 Downing
OL,20,FStreet on 13 October and their MP David
OL,21,FBurton-Sampson met Andy Burnham last
OL,22,Fweek to discuss it.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
